            {
              "q": "What is the Buzznerd AI Platform?",
              "a": "The AI under everything Buzznerd builds — the AI Assistant answers leads after hours, No-Touch CRM hands reps a ranked morning digest, Magic Flow builds listings from photos, and attribution traces every channel to the sold unit."
            },
            {
              "q": "Does the AI Assistant replace my salespeople?",
              "a": "No. It covers inbound questions when no salesperson is available and reads each buyer’s intent and readiness, then hands your team a warm brief. Prices, delivery promises, and trade values always stay human-only."
            },
            {
              "q": "What is the No-Touch CRM?",
              "a": "A ranked morning digest — not a data-entry CRM. It assembles your hottest follow-ups overnight with replies pre-drafted, so reps act instead of filing. It also plays nice with the CRM you already run."
            },
            {
              "q": "How fast can Magic Flow list a unit?",
              "a": "About a minute. Snap photos on the lot and Magic Flow builds the title, description, specs, and FAQs. You confirm what it found and set the price — including comp-based price guidance."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can I see which marketing channel actually sells units?",
              "a": "Yes. Channel-to-sale attribution ties every lead and sale back to the channel that produced it — real sold-unit results, not vanity metrics."
            }
